![input](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/45604720/112066435-91bb0080-8b23-11eb-9eb3-72e80fc1208d.png)

ImageMagick output

![ImageMagick](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/45604720/112066453-9a133b80-8b23-11eb-8c85-113f54c0acc2.png)

Sharp output 

![Sharp](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/45604720/112066456-9b446880-8b23-11eb-9269-ef8ef12df4cb.png)

