This extension currently does not support CSS nesting, to be added in 1.0.0.

Example:
<table><tr><th>CSS</th><th>NVSS 0.x</th><th>NVSS 1.0</th></tr>
<tr>
<td>

```css
footer {color: black;}
footer a {font-size: 90%;}
```

</td><td>

```less
footer {color: black;}
 & a {font-size: 90%;}
```

</td><td>

```less
footer {
  color: black;
  a {font-size: 90%;}
}
```

</td></tr></table>

Need to fix newlines breaking selector highlighting to allow for this.

Hello!

I'm trying to use `class LinkManagerToClient` on the web version with Google Ads V6, but I'm getting the following error: `Caught exception: Error occurred during parsing: Fail to push limit.`.
In V3 of Google Ads, it worked, but this version has been deprecated. My PHP version: 7.4

`
try {
  return (new GoogleAdsClientBuilder())
   ->fromFile()
   ->withOAuth2Credential($oAuth2Credential)
   ->withLoginCustomerId($loginCustomerId)
   ->build();
} catch (Exception $e) {
  echo 'Caught exception: ',  $e->getMessage(), "\n";
  exit;
}
`

Any information on how to solve it? Thanks.

## Describe the bug
Some info can be found here: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/67447308/how-to-use-aws-access-and-secret-keys-with-aws-sqs-sdk-v3-for-angular

I installed client sqs for my angular 10 app using the command `npm i @aws-sdk/client-sqs`.


## Your environment

#### SDK version number
@aws-sdk/client-sqs ^3.15.0

#### Is the issue in the browser/Node.js/ReactNative?
Node.js

#### Details of the browser/Node.js/ReactNative version
`node -v`
v12.18.1


## Steps to reproduce

I create a service to get data from sqs
```
  // Set the AWS Region
  REGION = "eu-west-3";

  // Set the parameters
  queueURL = "https://sqs.eu-west-3.amazonaws.com/xxxxxxxx/xxxxxx-mnotification-sqs-queue-dev";
  params = {
    AttributeNames: ["SentTimestamp"],
    MaxNumberOfMessages: 10,
    MessageAttributeNames: ["All"],
    QueueUrl: this.queueURL,
    VisibilityTimeout: 20,
    WaitTimeSeconds: 0,
  };
  // Create SQS service object
  sqs = new SQSClient({ region: this.REGION});

  /**
   * Recalculate the console user company activation
   */
  public receiveNotification() {
    const run = async () => {
      try {
        const data = await this.sqs.send(new ReceiveMessageCommand(this.params));
        if (data.Messages) {
          var deleteParams = {
            QueueUrl: this.queueURL,
            ReceiptHandle: data.Messages[0].ReceiptHandle,
          };
          try {
            //const data = await this.sqs.send(new DeleteMessageCommand(deleteParams));
            console.log("Message deleted", data);
          } catch (err) {
            console.log("Error", err);
          }
        } else {
          console.log("No messages to delete");
        }
      } catch (err) {
        console.log("Receive Error", err);
      }
    };
    run();
  }
```

#### Observed behavior
I have a bug in my console

```
Receive Error ReferenceError: process is not defined
    loadSharedConfigFiles index.js:11
    parseKnownFiles index.js:102
    fromIni index.js:31
    memoize memoize.js:22
